   <item row="6" column="0" colspan="2">
    <widget class="QLabel" name="labelHint">
     <property name="text">
      <string>A single terminal keeps the size it opened with. Two or more terminals on the same screen and desktop fill that screen. A terminal you snap yourself (Meta+arrows or dragging to a screen edge) stays where you put it. Other windows are never moved. Keyboard shortcuts are under System Settings → Keyboard → Shortcuts → KWin ("Terminal Tiler: …").</string>
